diagrams(ZZ,ZZ,ZZ) -- Partitions contained in a rectangle
*********************************************************

  * Function: *note diagrams: diagrams,
  * Usage: 
        diagrams(k,n,d)
  * Inputs:
      * k, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, maximum size of each entry in
        partitions
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, number of entries in partition
      * d, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, number being partitioned
  * Outputs:
      * a list of lists of integers $\{a_1, \dots, a_n\}$ such that $k \geq a_1
        \geq ... \geq a_n \geq 0$ and $\sum_{i=1}^n a_i = d$

